# LF everywhere, including Windows checkouts. This repository ships a systemd
# unit, a compose file and shell snippets that are read on Linux, and it is
# developed on both platforms, so line endings should not depend on whoever
# happened to clone it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Cargo.lock is generated but committed on purpose: this produces a binary, and
# a reproducible build matters more than a tidy diff.
Cargo.lock linguist-generated=true -merge
